Subject: AHM book website finally up !
Message-ID: <PAyk3jYrnVI.iLtkv-9PCwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/hmecology/c/PAyk3jYrnVI/m/iLtkv-9PCwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dear all,

exactly one year ago (though with publication date 2021!), Volume 2 of our statistical-ecology textbook "Applied hierarchical modelling in ecology" (AHM2) was published by Academic Press.

Now we have finally managed to create the accompanying book website, which briefly presents both the AHM1 and the AHM2 book, along with the whole AHMecology project and the philosophy of hierarchical statistical models. The website also contains further information, links and downloads.

https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/

We owe a very big thank-you to Jim Hines for creating and maintaining the page.

Best regards --- Marc, Andy and Mike

